# Dependencies cloned from upstream, each with its own history and remote.
# Committing them here would store them as gitlinks with no .gitmodules, which
# is a reference that breaks on clone rather than a copy of the code. The
# vendored copies that are plain source (imgui, minhook, extern) stay tracked.
#   Catch2  https://github.com/catchorg/Catch2.git  8b08d4d79514f45f7e4ce2a607ac9c94e920d1bb
#   common  https://github.com/ianpatt/common.git   64e233c096735551f6ac9a773726a8a3960e46cd
#   f4se    https://github.com/ianpatt/f4se.git     cb39721a8155b0ec31640291f2997fa1c43474af
/external/Catch2/
/external/common/
/external/f4se/
